> * Is it sound to cast `&[UnsafeCell<T>]` to `&[T]`, provided no mutation occurs while the reference is in use?
>   UCG says this is [not yet definitively OK because SB rejects it](https://github.com/rust-lang/unsafe-code-guidelines/issues/455) but the library documentation should at least explicitly caveat this.


